<title>SWITZERLAND: Winterthur sells unit to Trygg.</title>
<headline>Winterthur sells unit to Trygg.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winterthur Schweizerische Versicherungs-Gesellschaft said it was selling its Danish direct insurance unit  Tell Forsikring to Sweden's Trygg-Hansa group.</p>
<p>It gave no terms for the October 1 transaction, which must be approved by Danish authorities and depends on a thorough evaluation of the company.</p>
<p>&quot;This step is part of Winterthur's strategy to concentrate on large multinational customers in Scandinavian markets,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 73430</p>
